WEBVTT

00:03:28.955 --> 00:03:32.833
child and adolescent psychiatrist
in the whole country,

00:03:32.875 --> 00:03:38.589
we are expanding mental health care access
by training [18- to 22-year-old] Kenyans

00:03:38.631 --> 00:03:40.258
as lay providers.

00:03:40.925 --> 00:03:45.596
These young Kenyans are delivering
evidence-based care to their peers

00:03:45.596 --> 00:03:47.515
through a structured and tiered model

00:03:47.556 --> 00:03:51.978
that ensures that all young people
who want can get help.

00:03:52.019 --> 00:03:54.230
Because of a stigma of mental health

00:03:54.272 --> 00:03:57.024
that still exists from
Kenya's colonial past,

00:03:57.024 --> 00:03:58.526
we are delivering interventions

00:03:58.526 --> 00:04:01.404
without a formal diagnosis
of mental health,